OL,3,AUK does not support Trump's Russia
OL,4,Adiesel deal, says Streeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe argued that the US and other allies
OL,7,Fshould focus on increasing pressure on
OL,8,FRussia to shorten the war "and to
OL,9,Fsecure Ukraine's freedom".
OL,11,FThe US-Russia deal is aimed at lowering
OL,12,Ffuel prices in America which have risen
OL,13,Ffollowing the US and Israel's conflict
OL,14,Fwith Iran.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
