OL,3,A'Time for Ukraine to get new
OL,4,Apresident,' says Trump after Zelensky
OL,5,Acondemns diesel deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,8,Fthinks "it's time for Ukraine to get a
OL,9,Fnew president" as he responded to
OL,10,FVolodymyr Zelensky's criticism of the
OL,11,FUS diesel deal with Russia.
OL,13,FThe Ukrainian president warned a new
OL,14,Fdeal to release millions of tonnes of
OL,15,FRussian diesel into the US would
OL,16,Fprovide Moscow with money to continue
OL,17,Fits war against his nation, calling it
OL,18,Fa gift to Russian President Vladimir
OL,19,FPutin.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
